          "de": "",
          "en": "This hadith indicates that performing salat (prayer) while wearing an izār wrapped over the qamīṣ is permissible. The concluding statement reconciles the reports by explaining that some narrations indicate mere permissibility, while earlier ones refer to what is more virtuous and recommended.",
